    "s6": {
      "start": 120,
      "end": 158,
      "clip": "narration/s6.m4a",
      "speech": [120.5, 155.1],
      "text": "Under the hood, four rules. One: AI only reads. Claude turns slips into data, and never touches a number. Two: code does the math, under rules sealed before the season. Three: people approve. Two signatures lock one fingerprint of the batch. Four: PayPal moves the money. The invoice goes through PayPal's Agent Toolkit; payouts through our own tool, sent exactly once, and confirmed by signed notices. Every step is chained into a tamper-evident record.",
